ion Detection**:\n   The compound operation `glob++` on line 19 decomposes into:\n   - Read operation: read current value of `glob`\n   - Write operation: write `glob + 1` back to `glob`\n\n   The ISR can preempt between these operations, creating the pattern:\n   - **a1**: Read `glob` (line 19, main function)\n   - **a2**: Write `glob` (line 9, ISR preempts and modifies `glob`)\n   - **a3**: Write `glob` (line 19, main function resumes with stale value)\n\n```json\n{\n    \"violations\": [\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"glob\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Read\", \"Write\", \"Write\"],\n            \"lines\": [19, 9, 19]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n"
